{
  "name": "Email a daily report of your instances",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Email a daily report of your instances\n\nEvery day at 8:00, this workflow lists all instances of your LetzCloud account, writes their name, state, zone, and IP address to a CSV file, and emails the file.\n\n### Set up\n1. Install the community package `@altarys/n8n-nodes-letzcloud`.\n2. Select a **LetzCloud API** credential with a provider key in **Get all instances**. The key needs `vm:read`.\n3. Select an SMTP credential in **Email the report**.\n4. Change the addresses in **Settings**.\n5. Publish the workflow.\n\nIf the instances can't be read, the execution fails, so it shows as failed in the executions list.\n\nGuide: https://github.com/helmajbri/altarys-n8n-nodes/blob/main/packages/letzcloud/docs/examples.md",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "c2b3c4d5-0065-4000-8000-000000000066",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Read the instances\n**Get all instances** reads every page. It retries three times before the execution fails.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c2b3c4d5-0067-4000-8000-000000000068",
      "name": "Section: read",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Build and send the report\nOne row per instance, written to a CSV file and emailed.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c2b3c4d5-0069-4000-8000-00000000006a",
      "name": "Section: report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "c2b3c4d5-006b-4000-8000-00000000006c",
      "name": "Every day at 8:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c2b3c4d5-006d-4000-8000-00000000006e",
              "name": "toEmail",
              "value": "cloud-team@example.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c2b3c4d5-006f-4000-8000-000000000070",
              "name": "fromEmail",
              "value": "n8n@example.com",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c2b3c4d5-0071-4000-8000-000000000072",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "instance",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": true,
        "filters": {}
      },
      "id": "c2b3c4d5-0073-4000-8000-000000000074",
      "name": "Get all instances",
      "type": "@altarys/n8n-nodes-letzcloud.letzCloud",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c2b3c4d5-0075-4000-8000-000000000076",
              "name": "instance",
              "value": "={{ $json.name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c2b3c4d5-0077-4000-8000-000000000078",
              "name": "state",
              "value": "={{ $json.state }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c2b3c4d5-0079-4000-8000-00000000007a",
              "name": "zone",
              "value": "={{ $json.zone_name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c2b3c4d5-007b-4000-8000-00000000007c",
              "name": "ip_address",
              "value": "={{ $json.ip_address }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c2b3c4d5-007d-4000-8000-00000000007e",
      "name": "Report columns",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        680,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "csv",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "=instances-{{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-LL-dd') }}.csv"
        }
      },
      "id": "c2b3c4d5-007f-4000-8000-000000000080",
      "name": "Write CSV file",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        900,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.fromEmail }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.toEmail }}",
        "subject": "=LetzCloud instances on {{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-LL-dd') }}",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "=The attached file lists every instance of your LetzCloud account and its state.",
        "options": {
          "fileAttachments": "data"
        }
      },
      "id": "c2b3c4d5-0081-4000-8000-000000000082",
      "name": "Email the report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "errorMessage": "The instances could not be read from LetzCloud. Open the failed execution to see the message from the LetzCloud node."
      },
      "id": "c2b3c4d5-0083-4000-8000-000000000084",
      "name": "Stop: instances could not be read",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        140
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every day at 8:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Settings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Settings": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get all instances",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get all instances": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Report columns",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Stop: instances could not be read",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Report columns": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Write CSV file",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Write CSV file": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Email the report",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
